'''Growing Green''' (進化の緑マタタビ, ''Shinka no Midori Matabi'', '''Evolution Green Actinidia''') was the [[Catfruit]] gathering daily event of Monday. By clearing any of these stages, you might get a Green Catfruit, a Green Seed or an Epic Catfruit. You also have a small chance to unlock and play the special stage Catfruit Jubilee. This event was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

